        <body>
            <div xml:id="d88-a1-a10-a4-a3">

                <pb facs="0216" n="176" sameAs="frus:frus1865p1/pg176"/>

                <head>Lord Russell to Mr. Adams</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Foreign Office</hi>.</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 15, 1865</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Lord Russell presents his compliments to Mr. Adams, and has the honor to enclose
                    a copy of the letter of which Lord Russell spoke to Mr. Adams yesterday as
                    having been addressed <hi rendition="#italic">to</hi> Messrs. Mason, Slidell,
                    and Mann.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
